<title>UK: Power Finance Corp prices $100 mln 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Power Finance Corp prices $100 mln 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   POWER FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     7.5	 MATURITY    31.JUL.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.96     PAY DATE    31.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  70 BP     REOFFER    99.96     SPREAD	+135 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA3	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ</p>
<p>SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    30 BP     SELL CONC   40 BP</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/INDIA</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR U.S.T.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
